PROJECT TITLE: HIGH-CONCURRENCY TICKET BOOKING & WAITLIST ENGINE
Target Skill Level: Intermediate Core Java (Collections, Exceptions, Threads)
Real-World Inspiration: IRCTC Tatkal Booking / BookMyShow Flash Sales
